  "prefLabel": "Env-Hw 1003.03 Eligible Applicants; Match Required",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-Hw 1003.03 Eligible Applicants; Match Required.\n\n(a) Municipalities and approved local or regional entities that are in compliance with the hazardous waste rules shall be eligible to apply for HWCF monies for HHW collection projects.\n\n(b) A municipality may participate in multiple HHW collection projects, however a municipality’s population shall be counted toward only one grant application per year for purposes of calculating grant awards pursuant to Env-Hw 1003.08.\n\n(c) As required by RSA 147-B:6, I-a, recipients shall provide matching funds, on a dollar-for-dollar basis, equal to the total amount of HWCF monies received.\n\nSource. #12352, eff 8-14-17; ss by #14284, eff 8-1-25, EXPIRES: 8-1-35",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/env-hw1000.html"
